---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../styles/living.css';
---
<Layout title="Living Canvas — grow a work of your own" description="A generative material studio. Plant a texture, hold a detail, sculpt its light, and come back to keep creating.">
  <div class="living wrap" id="living-studio">
    <header class="living-heading"><div><a href="/lab/" class="living-back">← LAB & EXPERIMENTS</a><h1>Living <em>Canvas.</em></h1><p>A little intention. A little emergence.</p></div><span class="living-edition">MATERIAL STUDY / 001<br/>REACTION–DIFFUSION</span></header>
    <noscript>Enable JavaScript to use this local generative drawing studio.</noscript>
    <p id="living-status" class="living-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Preparing your material…</p>
    <div class="living-workspace">
      <aside class="living-tools" aria-label="Drawing and material tools">
        <section><div class="living-section-title"><h2>Make a mark</h2><span>01</span></div><div class="living-brushes" role="group" aria-label="Brush">{[['seed','✳','Seed'],['freeze','❄','Freeze'],['thaw','◌','Thaw'],['barrier','╱','Barrier'],['erase','⌫','Erase']].map(([id,icon,label])=><button data-brush={id} aria-pressed={id==='seed'?'true':'false'}><span aria-hidden="true">{icon}</span>{label}</button>)}</div><label>Brush radius <output id="living-radius-value">6</output><input id="living-radius" type="range" min="1" max="24" value="6"/></label><label class="living-check"><input id="living-regions" type="checkbox" checked/> Reveal frozen areas & barriers</label><p class="living-hint" id="living-brush-hint">Plant a living texture. Frozen areas are protected.</p></section>
        <section><div class="living-section-title"><h2>Shape the light</h2><span>02</span></div><div class="living-finishes" role="group" aria-label="Surface finish"><button data-material="mineral" aria-pressed="true"><i class="living-swatch mineral"></i>Mineral</button><button data-material="glaze" aria-pressed="false"><i class="living-swatch glaze"></i>Glaze</button></div><label>Light direction <output id="living-light-value">315°</output><input id="living-light" type="range" min="0" max="360" value="315"/></label><label>Relief <output id="living-relief-value">1.3</output><input id="living-relief" type="range" min="0.2" max="3" step="0.1" value="1.3"/></label><p class="living-hint">Material and lighting change the surface, never the growth underneath.</p></section>
        <section><div class="living-section-title"><h2>Let it grow</h2><span>03</span></div><label>Pace <select id="living-speed"><option value="30">Slow / 30 steps per second</option><option value="120" selected>Natural / 120 steps per second</option><option value="240">Fast / 240 steps per second</option></select></label><p class="living-hint">Target pace; slower devices take longer without skipping steps. Drawing pauses growth.</p></section>
      </aside>
      <section class="living-stage" aria-label="Artwork canvas">
        <div class="living-transport"><button id="living-run" class="living-primary">Grow ▶</button><button id="living-step">Step +1</button><button id="living-undo" disabled>Undo stroke</button><span id="living-state">PREPARING</span></div>
        <div class="living-frame"><div class="living-sheet" id="living-sheet"><canvas id="living-canvas" width="512" height="512" tabindex="0" aria-label="Living artwork. Drag to paint. Arrow keys position the brush, Enter paints, Space toggles growth."></canvas><div class="living-cursor" id="living-cursor" aria-hidden="true" hidden></div></div><div class="living-frame-caption"><span id="living-material-caption">MINERAL / WARM BRONZE</span><span id="living-tick">STEP 0</span></div></div>
        <div class="living-stage-footer"><span>256 × 256 living cells · sealed edges</span><span>Drag to paint · Space to grow / pause</span></div>
        <div class="living-artwork-actions"><label class="sr-only" for="living-name">Artwork name</label><input id="living-name" placeholder="Give this study a name" maxlength="80" value="First emergence"/><button id="living-save" class="living-primary">Save new copy</button><button id="living-png">Export PNG ↗</button></div>
        <div class="living-file-actions"><button id="living-image">Prepare for Image Bench ↗</button><a id="living-image-link" href="/tools/image/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open prepared snapshot ↗</a><button id="living-export">Export editable artwork</button><button id="living-import">Import artwork</button><input id="living-file" type="file" accept=".json,.living.json" hidden/><span id="living-dirty">Not saved on this device</span></div>
      </section>
    </div>
    <section class="living-collection" aria-labelledby="living-collection-title"><div class="living-collection-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">PICK UP WHERE YOU LEFT OFF</div><h2 id="living-collection-title">Your living studies<span>.</span></h2></div><div class="living-new"><label for="living-seed">Seed</label><input id="living-seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" step="1" value="17"/><button id="living-new">New seeded study</button><button id="living-blank">Blank canvas</button></div></div><p class="living-hint">Saved copies stay in this browser. Open one to continue or make a variation; saving never overwrites another copy.</p><div class="living-gallery" id="living-gallery"><p class="living-empty">Your first saved study will appear here.</p></div></section>
    <details class="living-about"><summary>How this material works</summary><p>One Gray–Scott growth material, two artistic surface finishes. Plant seeds and let the texture evolve. Freeze holds both chemical concentrations while allowing neighboring cells to diffuse against them. Barriers block diffusion. Thaw releases frozen areas; Erase clears texture, barriers and freezing together.</p><p>Undo keeps up to eight paused brush strokes. Resuming growth or stepping clears brush undo. Every saved artwork includes its chemical fields, regions, seed, step and finish. PNG exports omit editing overlays. File exports are editable backups, not Lab experiment files. No account, uploads or cloud sync.</p><p>Growth stops when this tab is hidden and must be resumed manually. Arrow keys move the brush; Enter paints; [ and ] resize it. Space toggles growth only while the canvas is focused.</p></details>
  </div>
  <script>import '../../scripts/living';</script>
</Layout>
